# General requests. Feature requests live next to their code:
#   features/contacts/contacts.http
#   features/messages/messages.http
#
# Run with VS Code (REST Client extension) or Visual Studio 2022 17.12+.
# Start the API first: dotnet run --launch-profile http

@WebAppApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

### Health check: 200 "Healthy"
GET {{WebAppApi_HostAddress}}/healthz

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{WebAppApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
